at, damp red scarf, orange carrot and three vertical dark stones are the melted remains of a snowman — the melted state must be reversed into a standing snowman at that exact spot","Map each remnant to its original position: three stones in a vertical line = coal buttons down the snowman's torso; carrot = nose on the middle/top ball; top hat = on the head; red scarf = around the neck (not on the fence post); puddle = the snowman's base on the lawn, fence post behind it","Identify which items are 'meant to have disappeared' in the reconstructed moment: the puddle/melted water and the muddy submerged state — everything else (hat, scarf, carrot, stones, fence) must reappear in its intact, pre-melt form"],"facts":["A standing three-ball snowman sits in the center of the front yard lawn, occupying the circular area of flattened grass.","Three dark round coal buttons are embedded in a vertical line down the front of the snowman's middle and lower body balls.","An orange carrot protrudes horizontally as the nose from the middle ball of the snowman.","A black top hat rests upright on the top ball of the snowman's head.","A red wool scarf is wrapped around the snowman's neck between the head and middle balls, with one end hanging down the front.","The lawn under and around the snowman is green grass with no puddle or muddy water, and a wooden fence post stands behind the snowman."],"rewrite_excerpt":"… Three dark round coal buttons are set in a vertical line … An orange carrot sticks out horizontally as the nose … black top hat … on the head ball … red wool scarf … around the neck … no puddle or muddy water …","rewrite_full":"A classic three-tier snowman standing in the center of a suburban front yard lawn on a bright winter day. The snowman is built from three stacked white snowballs: a large base ball, a middle ball, and a smaller head ball. Three dark round coal buttons are set in a vertical line down the front of the middle and lower balls. An orange carrot sticks out ho